  unitName: Voltage Cutlass Diana
  unitId: 40544
  unitNumber: 892
  description: One of the sacred Guardians of Meirith, who worshipped the Holy Emperor
    Karna Masta in the La Veda Republic. Diana was gifted with a sabre of thunder
    by the Holy Emperor when she had been unexpectedly appointed as a Guardian, regardless
    of her humble origins as fisherman's daughter. She gained confidence in the swordsmanship
    she had developed despite her father's opposition, and her faith grew stronger
    with it, though this only caused her to become unsure of her place in the world.
    Trapped in her own emotional struggle, it is said that Quaid came to irritate
    her with his easygoing and happy-go-lucky demeanor.
  summonDesc: Oh, no...seriously?<br>Are you sure you want me with you?<br>You won't
    get mad if I'm useless?
  fusionDesc: You shouldn't expect that much of me.<br>I'm not like everyone else,<br>I'm
    only human.
